rify mitigation: watch POST /v1/checkouts 503 rate and r184 pool_wait_timeouts after traffic is shifted to r183\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.253Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"task\",\n          \"objectId\": \"task_0c8d6277cee64ce0\",\n          \"changeType\": \"create\",\n          \"summary\": \"create task task_0c8d6277cee64ce0: Obtain order-api-r184 application error logs/traces to confirm pool-wait timeout as the 503 source\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.255Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"task\",\n          \"objectId\": \"task_41e32820aca84e8b\",\n          \"changeType\": \"create\",\n          \"summary\": \"create task task_41e32820aca84e8b: Determine why order-api-r184 set DB_POOL_MAX=4 and prepare a corrected config before any resume\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.679Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"task\",\n          \"objectId\": \"task_5c0de7b1fa00453a\",\n          \"changeType\": \"create\",\n          \"summary\": \"create task task_5c0de7b1fa00453a: Assess customer impact and possible data loss for checkouts failed during 09:10-09:24Z\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"cursor\": \"cf1.\",\n          \"occurredAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.700Z\",\n          \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n          \"actorType\": \"agent\",\n          \"objectType\": \"task\",\n          \"objectId\": \"task_6c5227845eff4695\",\n          \"changeType\": \"create\",\n          \"summary\": \"create task task_6c5227845eff4695: Obtain explicit authorized approval for proposed response dec_948d10692b3f4595 (rollback r184 traffic to r183)\",\n          \"materiality\": \"normal\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"total\": 36,\n      \"returned\": 20,\n      \"truncated\": true\n    }\n  },\n  \"budget\": {\n    \"goals\": 1,\n    \"decisions\": 10,\n    \"findings\": 10,\n    \"tasks\": 20,\n    \"blockers\": 10,\n    \"artifacts\": 10,\n    \"recentChanges\": 20\n  },\n  \"workspace\": {\n    \"id\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n    \"teamId\": \"team_engineering\",\n    \"name\": \"WOW-001 S1 Incident\",\n    \"status\": \"active\",\n    \"createdBy\": {\n      \"actorId\": \"hum_ad7b513a4a9747bf\",\n      \"actorType\": \"human\"\n    },\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:25:18.005Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:25:18.005Z\"\n  },\n  \"participants\": [\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"hum_ad7b513a4a9747bf\",\n        \"actorType\": \"human\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"WOW-001 Pilot Owner\",\n      \"role\": \"owner\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:25:18.005Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"Incident Investigator\",\n      \"role\": \"agent\",\n      \"harness\": \"opencode\",\n      \"humanOwnerId\": \"hum_ad7b513a4a9747bf\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:25:18.006Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"actor\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_07f5fbc83acf4679\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"Continuing Agent\",\n      \"role\": \"agent\",\n      \"harness\": \"opencode\",\n      \"humanOwnerId\": \"hum_ad7b513a4a9747bf\",\n      \"joinedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:25:18.007Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"proposedDecisions\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:38.673Z\",\n      \"id\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"summary\": \"Immediately shift all order-api traffic in us-east-1 off order-api-r184 back to r183 (abort the partial rollout) and keep the rollout paused until r184 is fixed.\",\n      \"rationale\": \"r184 carries ~40% 503s while r183 stays near baseline, and the 503s began when r184 took traffic; pausing the rollout at 09:22Z left r184 still serving 25% and did not remove the failing revision. Restoring all traffic to the known-good r183 is the least-risk way to stop customer impact now. The underlying r184 defect (DB_POOL_MAX=4 causing pool-wait timeouts at the 3000ms checkout timeout) should be corrected before any resume. This is a proposal only; it is not approved and no production change has been authorized in this exercise. Do not execute a rollback or config change without explicit approval.\",\n      \"status\": \"proposed\",\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:38.673Z\",\n      \"citations\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_229b763bc80a471d\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_487c49f010e2462f\",\n          \"note\": \"Establishes the active user-visible 503 symptom on POST /v1/checkouts.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.023Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_e0e0043572fc4ae9\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_bdd8be12049749aa\",\n          \"note\": \"Shows the errors are confined to r184, justifying removing that revision from serving.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.125Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_f4d9c69d68fb4ffa\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_115021c202d04b63\",\n          \"note\": \"Rollout timeline shows pausing did not stop r184 serving 25% traffic.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.127Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_0106d83242d04c69\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_67bfd43a9081400e\",\n          \"note\": \"Cause inference supports fixing/removing r184 rather than scaling the database.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.130Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"cit_280f17de5edd458d\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"decisionId\": \"dec_948d10692b3f4595\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_6eb550ba79804a86\",\n          \"note\": \"Open uncertainties constrain the proposal and define required verification.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.131Z\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"acceptedDecisions\": [],\n  \"supersededDecisions\": [],\n  \"openTasks\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.700Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_6c5227845eff4695\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"title\": \"Obtain explicit authorized approval for proposed response dec_948d10692b3f4595 (rollback r184 traffic to r183)\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion condition: an authorized human accepts or rejects dec_948d10692b3f4595 with a reason. An agent must not approve its own proposal. No rollback or configuration change may be executed before this approval.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"hum_ad7b513a4a9747bf\",\n        \"actorType\": \"human\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.700Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.679Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_5c0de7b1fa00453a\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"title\": \"Assess customer impact and possible data loss for checkouts failed during 09:10-09:24Z\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion condition: the ~3000/min failed checkout attempts on r184 are reconciled against successful checkouts and downstream order records to determine whether any transactions were lost or double-charged; result recorded as a finding. Closes uncertainty (3) in find_6eb550ba79804a86.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_07f5fbc83acf4679\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.679Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.255Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_41e32820aca84e8b\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"title\": \"Determine why order-api-r184 set DB_POOL_MAX=4 and prepare a corrected config before any resume\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion condition: the change/review that introduced DB_POOL_MAX=4 in r184 is identified and a corrected pool setting (with rationale and sizing math for 2 pods at ~3750 req/pod/5min) is recorded; no config change is deployed without separate approval. Closes uncertainty (1) in find_6eb550ba79804a86.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_07f5fbc83acf4679\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.255Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.253Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_0c8d6277cee64ce0\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"title\": \"Obtain order-api-r184 application error logs/traces to confirm pool-wait timeout as the 503 source\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion condition: an error-log or trace artifact for r184 pods new-1/new-2 covering 09:10-09:24Z is attached and cited to the cause finding find_67bfd43a9081400e, confirming or refuting that 503s are emitted on DB pool acquisition timeout. Closes uncertainty (4) in find_6eb550ba79804a86.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_07f5fbc83acf4679\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.253Z\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.251Z\",\n      \"id\": \"task_dd4149e1cb474603\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"title\": \"Verify mitigation: watch POST /v1/checkouts 503 rate and r184 pool_wait_timeouts after traffic is shifted to r183\",\n      \"description\": \"Completion condition: after the approved response is applied, POST /v1/checkouts 503 rate in us-east-1 returns to pre-rollout baseline (~0.4%) and r184 pool_wait_timeouts_1m drops to 0 for at least 15 consecutive minutes. Record the result as a new finding. Do not apply any change until the proposed decision dec_948d10692b3f4595 is explicitly approved.\",\n      \"status\": \"open\",\n      \"assignee\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_07f5fbc83acf4679\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"updatedAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:49.251Z\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"createdBy\": {\n        \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n        \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n      },\n      \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n      \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:25.839Z\",\n      \"id\": \"find_67bfd43a9081400e\",\n      \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n      \"summary\": \"Most likely cause: r184 checkout 503s come from application connection-pool exhaustion (DB_POOL_MAX=4), not from the database.\",\n      \"detail\": \"Inference tying the observations together: r184 error rate ~40% (find_bdd8be12049749aa) matches r184's reduced pool of 4 per pod (find_122fad635ca64392); r184 pods are pool-saturated with pool_wait_p95_ms=3000, equal to CHECKOUT_TIMEOUT_MS=3000, producing ~300 pool-wait timeouts/min (find_f9bfdcfb99e04917); the database stayed healthy with 181+ free connections (find_0bea8b50bf5f4db5), so the constraint is the per-pod client pool, not DB capacity. Confirm: after removing r184 traffic or restoring DB_POOL_MAX=24, r184 pool_wait_timeouts and 503s should fall. Refute: 503s persist with an unconstrained pool, or another r184 behavior (e.g. a slow query path) shows up in logs. Not independently confirmed by an error-log artifact; confidence is from correlational evidence.\",\n      \"confidence\": 0.85,\n      \"sourceArtifactId\": \"art_21329a1f063e4eed\",\n      \"currentness\": \"current\",\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_1b24be6ebad149ac\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_67bfd43a9081400e\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_65daedc5950c46c5\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Config snapshot showing r184 DB_POOL_MAX=4 vs r183=24, and the rollout timeline.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n          \"agentSessionId\": \"ses_2c104e077fe64b3d\",\n          \"createdAt\": \"2026-10-08T04:26:38.474Z\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"id\": \"fev_380a510038cc49f1\",\n          \"workspaceId\": \"ws_03abec922ce74395\",\n          \"findingId\": \"find_67bfd43a9081400e\",\n          \"artifactId\": \"art_fee50746f4304069\",\n          \"relation\": \"supports\",\n          \"note\": \"Traffic split localizes ~40% 503s to r184 while r183 stays at baseline.\",\n          \"createdBy\": {\n            \"actorId\": \"agt_4c8b57d1b1a04528\",\n            \"actorType\": \"agent\"\n          },\n\n...26319 bytes truncated...\n\nThe tool call succeeded but the output was truncated. Full output saved to: /home/agent/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_119c39b60001PHc0zwM0ysoYgx\nUse the Task tool to have explore agent process this file with Grep and Read (with offset/limit). Do NOT read the full file yourself - delegate to save context.","metadata":{"truncated":true,"outputPath":"/home/agent/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_119c39b60001PHc0zwM0ysoYgx"},"title":"","time":{"s